cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, data, or figures, please cite it as below."
title: "Norway Blue Carbon Map"
abstract: >-
  An interactive study-site map of Norwegian seagrass (Zostera marina) and
  kelp (Saccharina latissima and others) sampling locations, overlaid with
  habitat polygons, marine protected areas, environmental drivers, carbon
  stock and accumulation estimates, and human-pressure layers. Produced as
  part of the UC San Diego MAS CSP capstone project "Roadmap for Norwegian
  Blue Carbon Ecosystems as Nature-Based Solutions: Science-to-Policy Pathway
  Evaluation for Seagrass and Macroalgae Systems", in collaboration with the
  C-BLUES project / NIVA.
type: software
authors:
